<title>USA: RESEARCH ALERT - EOTT Energy downgraded.</title>
<headline>RESEARCH ALERT - EOTT Energy downgraded.</headline>
<text>
<p>-- Smith Barney has cut its rating for EOTT Energy Partners LP to outperform from buy, a source at the brokerage said on Friday.</p>
<p>-- Shares in the company closed on Thursday at 22.</p>
<p>((-- Wall Street desk (212) 859-1730))</p>
